  "body": "Lee Howson French Polisher's\n\nContact us now on: 07721581823 or 01132307371\n\nHOME\nSERVICES\nGALLERY OF PAST WORK\nCONTACT US\nLee Howson French Polisher's\n5⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nGET IN TOUCH\nFIND US ON YELL\nSome of the work carried out by us…\nAbout Us\n\n \n\nLee Howson French Polishers is a Leeds and Bradford French polishing business, boasting over 38 years of experience in both the antique trade and commercial sectors. Our esteemed clients include Harrods, Leeds Building Society, and various private individuals, with our work also featured on the BBC's DIY SOS.\n\nWe undertake projects of all sizes, from restoring antique furniture and applying modern wood finishes to crafting bespoke boardroom tables and refurbishing architectural elements such as staircases and doors. At LHFP, we are committed to delivering a personalised service, ensuring each piece receives the meticulous care and attention it deserves.\n\n\n\n\nCopyright © 2025 Lee Howson French Polisher's - All Rights Reserved.\n\nPowered by",
